  <item>
    <title>vol.30 追忆似水童年7：古厝记忆之小少年牧羊记</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6681958bcdd230b23b4952e1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6681958bcdd230b23b4952e1</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 30 Jun 2024 17:27:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我的很大一部分童年时光是在慵懒中度过。</span></p><span></span><p><span>比如在阳光热烈的午后，在水库边的草丛里躺一下午，与羊群作伴，什么事情也不做。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在太阳落山后，与父亲一起赶羊回古厝，看皎白的月光洒在父亲肩头，看光影在他肩头流动。</span></p><span></span><p><span>|song list|</span></p><span></span><p><span>Erik Satie-Gymnopedies 1</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loFvb7J7pWSFcisOSeBf2ZyFY-sz.m4a" length="17921086" type="audio/mp4"/>
